          "href": "https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/360054629031-Understanding-what-to-A-B-test-in-your-flows#h_01HHMZHVV056EY488NFRVE2SVE",
          "text": "Timing"
        },
        {
          "href": "https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/360054629031-Understanding-what-to-A-B-test-in-your-flows#h_01HHMZHVV1W0RF0THT6H788ZH5",
          "text": "Number of messages"
        },
        {
          "href": "https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/360054629031-Understanding-what-to-A-B-test-in-your-flows#h_01HHMZHVV17DEXV9CZD3A605KR",
          "text": "Subject lines (email only)"
        },
        {
          "href": "https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/360054629031-Understanding-what-to-A-B-test-in-your-flows#h_01HHMZHVV1AV7MH0M9QKXX7JCA",
          "text": "Content"
